# Theme Studio: built-in themes with a live preview, then Duplicate → Custom.
Output assets/readme/themes.gif
# demo-still: assets/readme/theme-studio.png 3s

Hide
Type "cd ~/Projects/demo && clear && nmsh"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Show

Type "/theme"
Sleep 0.5s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Down@5
Sleep 1.4s
Down@2
Sleep 1.4s
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "d"
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Type "git status --short"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
